      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is a transcription, vocalization, and translation of a manuscript of a prayer for peace in Europe held in the collection of the Columbia University Library. The prayer is undated but the language of the prayer and the use of Italian indicate to me that this was a prayer made by an Italian Jewish community during either the first Italian War of Independence 1848-9, or one of the two succeeding wars in 1860 and 1870. We are grateful to Aliza Arzt for her proofreading. (Thank you!) –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_34817_notes"/>
